caption: Required Five-Duan-Wei Progression
engine-rule: required-five-duan-wei-progression

Every Wuxia Tradition uses all five Duan Wei stages. A Tradition may add requirements or benefits, but may not collapse stages, replace Duan Wei with ordinary Tradition Mastery, or move the first and second Supernatural Unlocks away from Duan Wei 3 and Duan Wei 5 without an explicit GM ruling.
